but whoever you want...

00:14:35.040 --> 00:14:36.750
Yeah. You got to have rabbi Mordecai on.

00:14:36.750 --> 00:14:39.461
He's the best.
- He's amazing. Wow, wow.

00:14:39.461 --> 00:14:42.756
But I'm interested in how
