00:14:42.756 --> 00:14:47.761
I mean, essentially a Baha'i
actor and a Sufi Muslim

00:14:48.929 --> 00:14:52.516
walk into a bar or a soundstage and say,

00:14:52.516 --> 00:14:57.104
