00:15:02.735 --> 00:15:04.778
- It was a stage and it was...

00:15:05.863 --> 00:15:08.115
We met on a stage at USC

00:15:09.033 --> 00:15:11.994
and we were doing...

00:15:11.994 --> 00:15:14.330
I was emceeing an event about

00:15:14.330 --> 00:15:17.249
