00:16:37.621 --> 00:16:41.291
And at the time this
company that I had founded,

00:16:41.291 --> 00:16:44.670
SoulPancake, a digital media company that

00:16:44.670 --> 00:16:47.131
probes life's biggest questions

00:16:47.131 --> 00:16:51.927
and is all about uplifting
challenging content.

00:16:51.927 --> 00:16:54.972
They produced it and we
did season one on Luminary,

00:16:54.972 --> 00:16:58.976
now did season two out in
the general podcast O-sphere.

00:16:58.976 --> 00:17:00.644
And that's kind of how it started,

00:17:00.644 --> 00:17:03.981
but it was essentially a shared love of

00:17:03.981 --> 00:17:05.399
exactly what you were talking about.

00:17:05.399 --> 00:17:10.404
That there are these
huge questions about life

00:17:10.779 --> 00:17:15.200
that have been relegated to

00:17:15.200 --> 00:17:17.453
philosophical academics that you take

00:17:17.453 --> 00:17:19.621
