they're all pretty much

01:23:10.777 --> 01:23:12.320
saying the same thing."

01:23:12.320 --> 01:23:14.823
They are all pretty much
saying the same thing.

01:23:14.823 --> 01:23:16.783
That's actually true.

01:23:16.783 --> 01:23:21.788
But let's not devalue those
differences is all I will say.

01:23:22.288 --> 01:23:23.498
